title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/ddp_poster_14.jpeg
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Building the DDP's internal institutions.

= Party Organizations

Unlike the mass parties of the working class, we have never built a social world of our own. Our strength has instead ran through different channels, those being civic education, media and the professional and academic circles that make up our base.

- @newspapers: Fund more newspapers and journalists.
- @civic_education: Fund adult education and the Volkshochschule movement.
- @womens_orgs: Fund women's civic and professional organizations.
- @research: Help fund research and scientific discoveries.
- @jungdemokraten: We have the reputation of being a party for old men. Support the Jungdemokraten.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media

# TODO: differing outcomes based on whether you've seen media, and what kind of media you've supported.

@civic_education
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; new_middle_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); workers_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 3; 

We have increased funding to the Volkshochschule movement and other adult-education institutions. This way we ensure an educated citizenry, an essential measure against demagogues and dictators.

// For womens_orgs the popularity boost for all classes is supposed to symbolise popularity boost amongst women.

@womens_orgs
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; womens_organizing += 1; workers_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); rural_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); linksliberale_strength += 3; linksliberale_dissent -= 3 if linksliberale_dissent > 0 

We have increased funding to the women's civic and professional organizations that Bäumer and Lüders have spent years building. This way, we keep true to our roots of being a party in favour of women's sufferage.

@research
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; science += 1; new_middle_ddp += 2*(1-dissent); public_trust += 2; ddp_funded_science += 1

We have increased funding to scientific research and university institutes. Our party has always drawn heavily from the academic world, wich is where we got the nickname "the party of jews and professors" from, and while our enemies may use it negatively, there are worse reputations to have.

@jungdemokraten
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; young_democrats += 1; linksliberale_strength += 4; sammlung_dissent -= 2 if sammlung_dissent > 0

Our new young members flock chiefly to the Jungdemokraten, the party's own youth organization. This gives our party new blood, and strenghtens the organisation.


@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations.

- @return: Continue...
